---------------------------------------------------------------------------
NOTICE ABOUT THE REVERSE ENGINEERED CONTENT
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT license above covers the tooling, the documentation and the original
contributions made to this repository.

It does not cover the game itself.  Gangstar: West Coast Hustle was developed
and published by Gameloft.  All trademarks, artwork, audio, level data and
other game content remain the property of Gameloft and its licensors.

This repository contains a reverse engineering analysis of the game's native
library and a reconstruction of the game's behaviour in source form.  That
material is published for the purpose of preserving a game that is no longer
available for purchase, and for interoperability and research.

No game data is distributed here.  The retail shared object that this project
analyses is git ignored and must be obtained from your own copy of the game.

The vendored libraries under src/engine/ are upstream open source projects and
keep their own licences, which are listed in docs/ENGINE.md.
